function statKeyFromText(x){const t=String(x||'').trim().toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,' ');const m={'atk':'atk','attack':'atk','def':'def','defence':'def','defense':'def','hp':'hp','max hp':'hp','spd':'spd','speed':'spd','elemental mastery':'mast','physical mastery':'kfm','effect hit rate':'erate','effect res':'edodge','effect resistance':'edodge','elemental res':'eres','physical res':'pres','crit rate':'critValue','crit res':'critresValue','block':'blockValue','accuracy':'acc','crit dmg':'cd','dmg boost':'boost','dmg res':'dmgres'};return m[t]||STAT_KEY[t]||t.replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'');}
function parseStatPairs(text){const re=/(Elemental Mastery|Physical Mastery|Effect Hit Rate|Effect RES|Effect Resistance|Elemental RES|Physical RES|Crit Rate|Crit RES|Crit DMG|DMG Boost|DMG RES|Accuracy|Block|ATK|DEF|HP|SPD)\s*([+-]?\d[\d,]*(?:\.\d+)?\s*[kKmM]?%?)/gi;let m,out=[];while((m=re.exec(text||''))){const tok=m[2].replace(/\s+/g,''),mm=tok.match(/([+-]?[\d,]+(?:\.\d+)?)([kKmM])?(%?)/);if(!mm)continue;let v=parseFloat(mm[1].replace(/,/g,''));if(/[kK]/.test(mm[2]||''))v*=1000;if(/[mM]/.test(mm[2]||''))v*=1000000;let k=statKeyFromText(m[1]);if(mm[3]==='%'&&['critValue','critresValue','blockValue'].includes(k)){k=k==='critValue'?'cr':k==='critresValue'?'critres':'blockrate'}out.push({label:m[1],key:k,value:v});}return out;}
function parseEquipmentHtml(text){const doc=new DOMParser().parseFromString(text,'text/html'),wrap=doc.querySelector('.wrap');if(!wrap)return[];let level=-1,season='',slotPos='';const out=[];for(const el of wrap.children){if(el.matches('h2')){season=el.textContent.trim();const lm=(el.nextElementSibling?.textContent||'').match(/Level\s+(\d+) gear/i);if(lm)level=+lm[1];}if(el.matches('h3')){const t=el.textContent.trim(),lm=t.match(/^Level\s+(\d+)/i);if(lm)level=+lm[1];const h=el.querySelector('.hint')?.textContent||'';const pm=h.match(/^(.+?)\s*·/);if(pm)slotPos=pm[1].trim();}const table=el.matches('.tablewrap')?el.querySelector('table.equip'):null;if(!table)continue;table.querySelectorAll('tbody tr').forEach((tr,idx)=>{const td=[...tr.children];if(td.length<5)return;const name=td[0].querySelector('b')?.textContent.trim();if(!name)return;const hint=td[0].querySelector('.hint')?.textContent||'',type=(hint.split('·')[0]||'').trim(),line=(hint.split('·')[1]||'').trim(),quality=td[1].textContent.trim();const mainPairs=parseStatPairs(td[2].textContent);if(!mainPairs.length)return;const sec=parseStatPairs(td[3].textContent).map(x=>({label:x.label,key:x.key,value:x.value}));const sets=[...td[4].querySelectorAll('a')].map(a=>a.textContent.trim());const main=mainPairs[0];out.push({catalogId:`${name}|${quality}|${level}|${type}|${idx}`,name,type,quality,level,line,pos:slotPos||type,main:{key:main.key,value:main.value},secondaries:sec,sets,season,valueNote:'Synced from generated equipment.html; base value at the listed gear level.'});});}return out;}
function parseNpcHtml(text){const doc=new DOMParser().parseFromString(text,'text/html'),out=[];doc.querySelectorAll('table tbody tr').forEach(tr=>{const cells=[...tr.children].map(x=>x.textContent.trim());if(cells.length<5)return;const joined=cells.join(' | ');if(!/(HP|ATK|DEF|SPD)/i.test(joined))return;const nums=cells.map(c=>parseFloat(c.replace(/[^0-9.-]/g,''))).filter(Number.isFinite);if(nums.length<4)return;const name=cells[0];if(!name||name.length>80)return;const pairs=parseStatPairs(joined),obj={name:`NPC: ${name}`,kind:'PvE',rank:$('enemyRank')?.value||'Champion I',level:num('enemyLevel')||110,hp:0,def:0,spd:0,eres:0,pres:0,critres:0,dmgres:0,pveres:0,blockrate:0,blockeff:100,skillred:0};pairs.forEach(p=>{if(p.key==='hp'||p.key==='def'||p.key==='spd'||p.key==='eres'||p.key==='pres')obj[p.key]=p.value});if(obj.hp||obj.def||obj.spd)out.push(obj);});return out.slice(0,250);}
function installCatalog(gear,npcs=[],save=true){runtimeGear=[...DM.gear];const seen=new Set(runtimeGear.map(g=>`${g.name}|${g.quality}|${g.level}|${g.type}`));(gear||[]).forEach(g=>{const k=`${g.name}|${g.quality}|${g.level}|${g.type}`;if(!seen.has(k)){seen.add(k);runtimeGear.push(g);}const existing=GEAR_BY_NAME.get(g.name.toLowerCase());if(!existing||(+g.level||0)>=(+existing.level||0))GEAR_BY_NAME.set(g.name.toLowerCase(),g);});runtimeNpcs=[...BUILTIN_PRESETS,...(npcs||[])];extras.npcPresets=runtimeNpcs;if(save){try{localStorage.setItem(CATALOG_KEY,JSON.stringify({gear,npcs}))}catch(e){}}updateCatalogStatus();combos.forEach(c=>{try{c.filter()}catch(e){}});}
async function syncDatamine(){const b=$('syncDatamineBtn'),st=$('catalogStatus');b.disabled=true;st.textContent='Syncing…';st.className='status-chip warn';try{const [eq,npc]=await Promise.all([fetch(RAW_BASE+'equipment.html').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error('equipment '+r.status);return r.text()}),fetch(RAW_BASE+'npcs.html').then(r=>r.ok?r.text():'').catch(()=> '')]);const gear=parseEquipmentHtml(eq),npcs=npc?parseNpcHtml(npc):[];installCatalog(gear,npcs,true);st.textContent=`Synced · ${gear.length} gear variants`;st.className='status-chip good';toast('Source catalog synced');}catch(e){st.textContent='Sync failed · using local catalog';st.className='status-chip bad';toast('Could not sync source catalog')}finally{b.disabled=false}}
function updateCatalogStatus(){if(!$('catalogGearCount'))return;$('catalogGearCount').textContent=runtimeGear.length;$('catalogNpcCount').textContent=runtimeNpcs.length;if(runtimeGear.length>DM.gear.length){$('catalogStatus').textContent='Expanded catalog cached locally';$('catalogStatus').className='status-chip good';}}
function gearOptions(){return runtimeGear.map(g=>({label:g.name,value:g.catalogId||g.name,sub:[g.pos||g.type,g.quality,g.level>0?'Lv '+g.level:''].filter(Boolean).join(' · '),gear:g}));}
function canonicalSlot(g){return g?.pos||({'Sword':'Main','Staff':'Main','Shield':'Off-Hand','Gloves':'Off-Hand','Spellbook':'Off-Hand','Orb':'Off-Hand','Helmet':'Helmet','Armor':'Armor','Boots':'Boots'}[g?.type]||g?.type||'Custom');}
function itemStatsFromGear(g,secondary){const rows=[];const m=gearMain(g);if(m)rows.push([m[0],m[1]]);const s=(g.secondaries||[]).find(x=>x.label===secondary)||(g.secondaries||[])[0];if(s)rows.push([s.key,s.value]);return rows;}
function statsText(stats){return (stats||[]).map(([k,v])=>`${k}:${v}`).join(', ')}
function parseStatsText(t){return String(t||'').split(/[,;\n]+/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean).map(x=>{let [k,v]=x.split(/[:=]/);return [statKeyFromText(k),parseFloat(String(v||'0').replace(/,/g,''))||0]});}
function addInventoryItem(seed={}){const id='inv_'+Date.now().toString(36)+'_'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7);extras.inventory.push({id,equipped:false,use:true,name:'',slot:'',secondary:'',set:'',stats:[],source:'custom',...seed});saveExtras();renderInventory();}
function renderInventory(){const body=$('inventoryBody');if(!body)return;body.innerHTML='';extras.inventory.forEach((it,idx)=>{const tr=document.createElement('tr');tr.dataset.id=it.id;tr.innerHTML=`<td><input class="inv-equipped" type="checkbox" ${it.equipped?'checked':''}></td><td><input class="inv-use" type="checkbox" ${it.use!==false?'checked':''}></td><td class="wide"><input class="inv-name" value="${esc(it.name||'')}" autocomplete="off"><div class="tiny muted inv-meta">${esc(String(it.source||'custom').replace(/datamine/ig,'Source data'))}</div></td><td><input class="inv-slot" value="${esc(it.slot||'')}" autocomplete="off"></td><td><input class="inv-secondary" value="${esc(it.secondary||'')}" autocomplete="off"></td><td><input class="inv-set" value="${esc(it.set||'')}" autocomplete="off"></td><td class="stats-text"><input class="inv-stats" value="${esc(statsText(it.stats||[]))}" placeholder="spd:6418, atk:3209"></td><td><button class="icon-btn inv-remove" type="button">×</button></td>`;body.appendChild(tr);const name=tr.querySelector('.inv-name'),sec=tr.querySelector('.inv-secondary');attachCombo(name,gearOptions,o=>{const g=o.gear||GEAR_BY_NAME.get(o.label.toLowerCase());if(!g)return;name.value=g.name;it.name=g.name;it.slot=canonicalSlot(g);it.set=(g.sets||[])[0]||'';it.secondary=(g.secondaries||[])[0]?.label||'';it.stats=itemStatsFromGear(g,it.secondary);it.source='datamine';saveExtras();renderInventory();});attachCombo(tr.querySelector('.inv-slot'),['Main','Off-Hand','Helmet','Armor','Boots']);attachCombo(sec,()=>{const g=runtimeGear.find(g=>g.name===name.value);return (g?.secondaries||[]).map(x=>({label:x.label,sub:fmt(x.value),sec:x}))},o=>{const g=runtimeGear.find(g=>g.name===name.value),s=(g?.secondaries||[]).find(x=>x.label===o.label);if(g&&s){it.secondary=s.label;it.stats=itemStatsFromGear(g,s.label);saveExtras();renderInventory();}});tr.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(inp=>inp.addEventListener('change',()=>{it.equipped=tr.querySelector('.inv-equipped').checked;it.use=tr.querySelector('.inv-use').checked;it.name=name.value;it.slot=tr.querySelector('.inv-slot').value;it.secondary=sec.value;it.set=tr.querySelector('.inv-set').value;it.stats=parseStatsText(tr.querySelector('.inv-stats').value);saveExtras();}));tr.querySelector('.inv-remove').onclick=()=>{extras.inventory.splice(idx,1);saveExtras();renderInventory()};});}
function renderSetRules(){const b=$('setRulesBody');if(!b)return;b.innerHTML='';extras.setRules.forEach((r,i)=>{r.trigger=r.trigger||'always';r.chance=r.chance==null?100:r.chance;const tr=document.createElement('tr');tr.innerHTML=`<td><input value="${esc(r.set)}"></td><td><input type="number" min="1" value="${r.pieces}"></td><td><input value="${esc(r.stat)}"></td><td><input value="${esc(r.mode)}"></td><td><input type="number" step="0.1" value="${r.value}"></td><td><input value="${esc(r.trigger)}"></td><td><input type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="${r.chance}"></td><td><span class="source-badge ${String(r.source).startsWith('datamine')?'exact':''}">${esc(String(r.source||'custom').replace(/datamine/ig,'Source data'))}</span></td><td><button class="icon-btn">×</button></td>`;b.appendChild(tr);const ins=tr.querySelectorAll('input');attachCombo(ins[2],statOptions().concat(['Physical','Fire','Water','Wind','Light','Dark']));attachCombo(ins[3],['flat','percent','special','proc-damage','heal-hp','shield-hp','shield-def','dmg-boost','dmg-reduce','status']);attachCombo(ins[5],['always','beforeBattle','onTechniqueHit','whenHitByTechnique','turnStart','turnEnd','hpBelow50']);ins.forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('change',()=>{r.set=ins[0].value;r.pieces=+ins[1].value||1;r.stat=STAT_KEY[ins[2].value.toLowerCase()]||ins[2].value;r.mode=ins[3].value;r.value=+ins[4].value||0;r.trigger=ins[5].value||'always';r.chance=clamp(+ins[6].value||0,0,100);r.source=r.source||'custom';saveExtras()}));tr.querySelector('button').onclick=()=>{extras.setRules.splice(i,1);saveExtras();renderSetRules()};});}
function setCounts(items){const m={};items.forEach(it=>{if(it.set)m[it.set]=(m[it.set]||0)+1});return m;}
function applySetRules(sheet,items,sign=1,skills=null){const counts=setCounts(items);extras.setRules.forEach(r=>{if((counts[r.set]||0)<r.pieces)return;const v=sign*(+r.value||0);if(r.mode==='percent'&&['atk','def','hp','spd'].includes(r.stat))sheet[r.stat]*=(1+v/100);else if(r.mode==='flat'&&r.stat)sheet[r.stat]=(sheet[r.stat]||0)+v;else if(r.mode==='special'&&r.stat==='firstCd'&&skills){skills._firstCd=(skills._firstCd||0)+v;}});return counts;}
function inventorySheetFor(combo,s){const base=deep(s.build),equipped=equippedGearV59();equipped.forEach(x=>applyStats(base,x.stats,-1));applySetRules(base,equipped,-1);(combo||[]).forEach(x=>applyStats(base,x.stats,1));applySetRules(base,combo,1);base.atk=Math.max(1,base.atk);base.def=Math.max(0,base.def);base.hp=Math.max(1,base.hp);base.spd=Math.max(1,base.spd);return base;}
function pveRotation(sheet,s,skills=s.skills,fantomon=effectivePveFantomon(),items=[]){const ai=actionInfo(sheet,s),actions=ai.actions,load=(skills||[]).filter(x=>x.on&&x.coef>0).map(deep),ready=load.map(x=>(x.ready||x.cd<=0)?1:x.cd+1),seq=[];let total=0,cdReduce=(fantomon?.enabled&&fantomon.name==='Pandarial'?1:0),defScale=1,nyxStacks=0,chomNext=0,firstCd=0;const cnt=setCounts(items);if((cnt['Chanting Prelude']||0)>=4)firstCd=1;for(let turn=1;turn<=actions;turn++){let pick=-1;for(let i=0;i<load.length;i++)if(turn>=ready[i]){pick=i;break}let sk;if(pick>=0){sk=load[pick]}else sk={on:true,name:'Basic Attack',element:'Physical',coef:100,flat:0,hits:1,cd:0,ready:true,weight:1};const en={...s.enemy,def:s.enemy.def*Math.max(.35,defScale-chomNext)};const d=expectedSkillDamage(sheet,en,{...sk,weight:1},'pve');total+=d;seq.push({turn,name:sk.name,damage:d,enemyDef:en.def});if(pick>=0){let cd=Math.max(1,(sk.cd||1)-cdReduce-(turn===1?firstCd:0));ready[pick]=turn+cd;if(fantomon?.enabled&&fantomon.name==='Nyxarchon'){nyxStacks=Math.min(3,nyxStacks+1);defScale=1-.10*nyxStacks;}if(fantomon?.enabled&&fantomon.name==='Chomusuke'){chomNext=.075;}else chomNext=0;}else chomNext=0;}return {...ai,total,dpa:actions?total/actions:0,sequence:seq,fantomonNotes:fantomonCoverage(fantomon)};}
function fantomonCoverage(f){if(!f?.enabled||!f.name)return {level:'exact',text:'No Fantomon selected.'};const modeled={Pandarial:'Technique cooldown -1 is modeled.',Aegiswing:'50% lost-HP restoration after 3 owner turns is modeled in PvP.',Terragon:'50% ATK-reduction trigger is modeled in PvP.',Nyxarchon:'10% stacking DEF reduction is modeled; extra attack damage is not.',Chomusuke:'50% DEF-reduction trigger is modeled; extra attack damage is not.'};return modeled[f.name]?{level:'partial',text:modeled[f.name]}:{level:'partial',text:'Fantomon is tracked, but its support coefficient/effect magnitude is not fully exposed in the bundled snapshot, so unsupported parts are not assigned invented values.'};}
function evaluate(sheet,s){return pveRotation(sheet,s,s.skills,effectivePveFantomon(),[])}
function objectiveScore(sheet,s,obj){const rot=pveRotation(sheet,s,s.skills,effectivePveFantomon(),[]),surv=survivabilityMetrics(sheet,s.enemy);if(obj==='Survivability')return surv.effectiveHp;if(obj==='Balanced')return Math.sqrt(Math.max(1,rot.total)*Math.max(1,surv.effectiveHp));if(obj==='PvP analytical')return analyticalPvpScore(sheet,s.pvp.enemy,s.skills);return rot.total;}
function combinations(arr,k,limit=100000){const out=[];function rec(start,cur){if(out.length>=limit)return;if(cur.length===k){out.push(cur.slice());return}for(let i=start;i<=arr.length-(k-cur.length);i++){cur.push(arr[i]);rec(i+1,cur);cur.pop();if(out.length>=limit)return}}rec(0,[]);return out;}
function cartesian(groups,limit){let out=[[]];for(const g of groups){const next=[];for(const a of out){for(const x of g){next.push([...a,x]);if(next.length>=limit)break}if(next.length>=limit)break}out=next;if(out.length>=limit)break}return out;}
function gearObjectiveValue(combo,s,obj){const sheet=inventorySheetFor(combo,s);if(num('gearMinSpd')&&sheet.spd<num('gearMinSpd'))return -Infinity;if($('gearRequireFirst').checked){const ar=rankObj(sheet.rank),er=rankObj(s.enemy.rank);if(sheet.spd*ar.speedScale<=s.enemy.spd*er.speedScale)return-Infinity;}if(obj==='PvP win estimate'){return analyticalPvpScore(sheet,s.pvp.enemy,s.skills)}return objectiveScore(sheet,s,obj);}
function runGearOptimizer(){const s=collect(),pool=extras.inventory,groups=Object.values(pool.reduce((m,x)=>{(m[x.slot||'Custom']??=[]).push(x);return m},{}));if(!groups.length){$('gearOptimizerResult').innerHTML='<p class="negative">Add inventory items first.</p>';return}const cap=clamp(num('gearSearchCap')||50000,100,500000),combosX=cartesian(groups,cap),obj=$('gearObjective').value;const scored=combosX.map(c=>({combo:c,score:gearObjectiveValue(c,s,obj),sheet:inventorySheetFor(c,s)})).filter(x=>Number.isFinite(x.score)).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score).slice(0,5);if(obj==='PvP win estimate')scored.forEach(x=>{x.win=quickWinRate(x.sheet,s.pvp.enemy,s.skills,s.pvp.skills,s.charms,s.pvp.charms,s.fantomon,s.pvp.enemyFantomon,120)});if(obj==='PvP win estimate')scored.sort((a,b)=>b.win-a.win);lastBestGear=scored[0]||null;$('saveBestGearBtn').disabled=!lastBestGear;$('gearOptimizerResult').innerHTML=scored.map((r,i)=>`<div class="build-result ${i===0?'best':''}"><h4>${i===0?'Best build':'#'+(i+1)} · ${obj==='PvP win estimate'?(r.win*100).toFixed(1)+'% win':fmt(r.score)}</h4><div class="build-lines">${r.combo.map(x=>`<span><b>${esc(x.slot)}</b> ${esc(x.name)}</span>`).join('')}<span><b>SPD</b> ${fmt(r.sheet.spd)}</span><span><b>ATK</b> ${fmt(r.sheet.atk)}</span></div></div>`).join('')||'<p>No legal build met the constraints.</p>';}
function skillFromName(name,baseRank=22,level=127){const sk=SKILL_BY_NAME.get(String(name).trim().toLowerCase());if(!sk)return null;const row=skillAtRank(sk,baseRank),est=estimateTotalCoef(sk,row);if(est.value==null)return null;return {on:true,name:sk.name,id:sk.id,skillRank:String(baseRank),skillLevel:level,element:sk.element||'Physical',coef:est.value,flat:0,hits:sk.hits||1,cd:+row.CD||0,ready:(+row.CD||0)===0,weight:1};}
function runTechOptimizer(){const s=collect(),names=$('techPool').value.split(/\n+/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean).slice(0,12),rnk=skillRankNum(s.skills.find(x=>x.on)?.skillRank||22),lvl=s.skills.find(x=>x.on)?.skillLevel||s.build.level,pool=names.map(n=>skillFromName(n,rnk,lvl)).filter(Boolean);if(pool.length<4){$('techOptimizerResult').innerHTML='<p class="negative">Add at least 4 damaging Techniques.</p>';return}const cs=combinations(pool,4,2000).map(c=>({c,score:pveRotation(s.build,s,c,s.fantomon,[]).total})).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score).slice(0,5);$('techOptimizerResult').innerHTML=cs.map((x,i)=>`<div class="build-result ${i===0?'best':''}"><b>${i===0?'Best':'#'+(i+1)}</b> · ${fmt(x.score)} total<br><small>${x.c.map(s=>esc(s.name)).join(' · ')}</small></div>`).join('');}
function runCharmOptimizer(){const s=collect(),names=$('charmPool').value.split(/\n+/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean).slice(0,8),pool=names.map(n=>{const sk=SKILL_BY_NAME.get(n.toLowerCase());return sk?{name:sk.name,id:sk.id,skillRank:s.charms.find(c=>c.name)?.skillRank||'22',skillLevel:s.build.level}:null}).filter(Boolean);if(pool.length<4){$('charmOptimizerResult').innerHTML='<p class="negative">Add at least 4 Charms.</p>';return}const cs=combinations(pool,4,100).map(c=>({c,win:quickWinRate(s.build,s.pvp.enemy,s.skills,s.pvp.skills,c,s.pvp.charms,s.fantomon,s.pvp.enemyFantomon,60)})).sort((a,b)=>b.win-a.win).slice(0,5);$('charmOptimizerResult').innerHTML=cs.map((x,i)=>`<div class="build-result ${i===0?'best':''}"><b>${i===0?'Best':'#'+(i+1)}</b> · ${(x.win*100).toFixed(1)}% win estimate<br><small>${x.c.map(c=>esc(c.name)).join(' · ')}</small></div>`).join('');}
function runUpgradeNext(){const s=collect(),base=pveRotation(s.build,s,s.skills,s.fantomon,[]).total,rows=[];[['ATK','atk',1000],['Elemental Mastery','mast',1000],['Physical Mastery','kfm',1000],['SPD','spd',1000],['Crit Rate','cr',1],['Crit DMG','cd',1],['DMG Boost','boost',1],['Accuracy','accPct',1]].forEach(([label,k,v])=>{const b=deep(s.build);if(k==='accPct')b.acc=(b.acc||0)+(rankObj(b.rank).BaseBlockAvoidPercentValue||1)*(v/100);else b[k]=(b[k]||0)+v;const val=pveRotation(b,s,s.skills,s.fantomon,[]).total;rows.push({name:`+${v} ${label}`,gain:deltaPct(base,val),kind:'stat'});});s.skills.forEach((sk,i)=>{if(!sk.on)return;const obj=SKILL_BY_NAME.get(sk.name.toLowerCase()),n=skillRankNum(sk.skillRank);if(obj&&n<34){const row=skillAtRank(obj,n+1),est=estimateTotalCoef(obj,row);if(est.value!=null){const ss=deep(s.skills);ss[i].coef=est.value;ss[i].skillRank=String(n+1);const val=pveRotation(s.build,s,ss,s.fantomon,[]).total;rows.push({name:`${sk.name}: ${DM.rankLabels[n]} → ${DM.rankLabels[n+1]}`,gain:deltaPct(base,val),kind:'skill'});}}});const equipped=equippedGearV59();extras.inventory.filter(x=>!equippedGearV59().some(e=>e.id===x.id)).forEach(it=>{const old=equipped.find(x=>x.slot===it.slot);if(!old)return;const combo=equipped.filter(x=>x!==old).concat(it),sheet=inventorySheetFor(combo,s),val=pveRotation(sheet,s,s.skills,s.fantomon,combo).total;rows.push({name:`${it.slot}: ${old.name} → ${it.name}`,gain:deltaPct(base,val),kind:'gear'});});rows.sort((a,b)=>b.gain-a.gain);$('upgradeNextResult').innerHTML='<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Upgrade</th><th>Expected PvE change</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,12).map(r=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.name)}</td><td class="${r.gain>0?'positive':''}">${pct(r.gain)}</td><td>${r.kind}</td></tr>`).join('')+'</tbody></table></div>';}
function survivabilityMetrics(me,enemy){const dummy={...enemy,atk:enemy.atk||enemy.def||250000,rank:enemy.rank||me.rank,level:enemy.level||me.level,cr:enemy.cr||0,cd:enemy.cd||50,boost:enemy.boost||0,pvpadd:enemy.pvpadd||0,acc:enemy.acc||0,kfm:enemy.kfm||0,mast:enemy.mast||0,affFire:0,affWater:0,affWind:0,affLight:0,affDark:0};const sk={on:true,element:'Physical',coef:100,flat:0,hits:1,weight:1};const hit=expectedSkillDamage(dummy,me,sk,'pvp'),naked={...me,def:0,dmgres:0,pvpres:0,blockrate:0,blockeff:0,critres:0,pres:0,eres:0},raw=Math.max(1,expectedSkillDamage(dummy,naked,sk,'pvp')),hits=hit>0?me.hp/hit:Infinity,ehp=hit>0?me.hp*raw/hit:Infinity;return {hit,hits,effectiveHp:ehp,rawHit:raw};}
function renderSpeedDashboard(){if(!$('speedDashboard'))return;const s=collect(),ai=actionInfo(s.build,s),gap=Math.ceil(ai.next-s.build.spd),prev=Math.floor(ai.prev);$('speedDashboard').innerHTML=`<div class="mini-grid"><div><span class="muted">Your SPD</span><div class="big-stat">${fmt(s.build.spd)}</div></div><div><span class="muted">Actions</span><div class="big-stat">${ai.actions}</div></div><div><span class="muted">Next breakpoint</span><div class="big-stat">${fmt(Math.ceil(ai.next))}</div></div><div><span class="muted">Gap</span><div class="big-stat">${gap>0?'+'+fmt(gap):'crossed'}</div></div></div><p class="hint">Over ${s.turns} enemy turns. Previous threshold: ${fmt(prev)} SPD. First actor: ${ai.first}.</p>`;}
