function renderRotation(){if(!$('rotationDashboard'))return;const s=collect(),r=pveRotation(s.build,s,s.skills,effectivePveFantomon(),equippedGearV59());$('rotationDashboard').innerHTML=`<div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><span>Total expected damage</span><strong>${fmt(r.total)}</strong><small>${r.actions} actions</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Healing</span><strong>${fmt(r.healing)}</strong><small>modeled healing</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Shields granted</span><strong>${fmt(r.shield)}</strong><small>modeled shield value</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Proc damage</span><strong>${fmt(r.proc)}</strong><small>Charms / Fantomon / sets</small></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Your turn</th><th>Action</th><th>Damage</th><th>Healing</th><th>Shield</th><th>Enemy DEF</th></tr></thead><tbody>${r.sequence.slice(0,40).map(x=>`<tr><td>${x.turn}</td><td>${esc(x.name)}</td><td>${fmt(x.damage)}</td><td>${fmt(x.healing)}</td><td>${fmt(x.shield)}</td><td>${fmt(x.enemyDef)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="hint">${esc(r.fantomonNotes.text)}</p>`;}
