function dispatchRulesV3(owner,event,ctx,depth=0){if(depth>=4)return;for(const r of compactRulesV3(owner,event)){r._counts=r._counts||{};const ck=ctx.att?.rt?.turn||0;if(r.eachRoundMax&&((r._counts[ck]||0)>=r.eachRoundMax))continue;r._seen=(r._seen||0)+1;if(r.conditionCount&&r._seen%r.conditionCount)continue;if(Math.random()*100>+(r.chance??100))continue;r._counts[ck]=(r._counts[ck]||0)+1;for(const a of r.actions||[]){const src=ctx.att,tgt=a.target==='self'?ctx.att:(ctx.target||ctx.def);if(!src||!tgt)continue;if(a.type==='damage'){const coef=+a.coef||0,sk={on:true,name:r.name||'EC proc',element:a.element||'Physical',coef,flat:+a.flat||0,hits:+a.hits||1};secondaryHitV3(src,tgt,sk)}else if(a.type==='heal'){healV11(tgt.rt,tgt.rt.maxHp*(+a.hpPct||0)/100+(+a.flat||0))}else if(a.type==='shield'){addShieldV11(tgt.rt,tgt.rt.maxHp*(+a.hpPct||0)/100+Math.max(0,effV11(tgt.rt,src.rt).def)*(+a.defPct||0)/100,+a.duration||1,r.name||'EC shield')}else if(a.type==='status'){addStatusV11(tgt.rt,a.key||'boost',+a.value||0,+a.duration||1,r.name||'EC status',a.kind||'debuff',1,+a.maxStacks||1)}else if(a.type==='remove-status'){tgt.rt.statuses=tgt.rt.statuses.filter(x=>a.kind?x.kind!==a.kind:x.key!==a.key)}else if(a.type==='cooldown'){tgt.rt.ready=tgt.rt.ready.map(x=>Math.max(tgt.rt.turn,x+(+a.turns||0)))}else if(a.type==='move'){teamPushV3(tgt,src,+a.distance||1,ctx.units)}else if(a.type==='grid-hazard'){addGridHazardV3(src,tgt,a,r);fireHazardsAtV3(tgt,'start')}else if(a.type==='child-skill'){const sk=SKILL_BY_ID_V3.get(+a.skillId);if(sk)executeTeamSkillV3(src,[tgt],sk,ctx.units,depth+1)}}}}
function unitRuleOwnersV3(u){const out=(u.charms||[]).filter(x=>x&&x.name).map(x=>({id:x.id,name:x.name}));const counts={};for(const it of u.rt.items||[])if(it.set)counts[it.set]=(counts[it.set]||0)+1;for(const [name,n] of Object.entries(counts))if(n>=2)out.push({id:0,name});return out}
