// ====================== v5.5 automatic live-JSON Relic stats ======================
// Explicit numeric fields are preferred. If a row only exposes the public API's
// reference description (for example "+55" with stats:["SPD"]), that value is
// automatically used for an equipped Relic and is visibly labeled DERIVED.
const RELIC_PERCENT_STATS_V55=new Set(['Crit Rate','Crit DMG','Crit RES','DMG Boost','DMG RES','PvE Bonus DMG','PvE DMG RES','PvP Bonus DMG','PvP DMG RES','Block Rate','Block Efficiency']);
